{"id":"5c8ba0e6355b38cd","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-measure3-distribution-of-random-variable.md","title":"ZFC Measure3 Distribution Of Random Variable","display":"df-zfc-measure3-distribution-of-random-variable — ZFC Measure3 Distribution Of Random Variable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure3-distribution-of-random-variable","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure3-distribution-of-random-variable","58-df-zfc-measure11-distribution-of-random-variable"],"display":"df-zfc-measure3-distribution-of-random-variable — ZFC Measure3 Distribution Of Random Variable","depends_on":["[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure3-distribution-of-random-variable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure3-distribution-of-random-variable</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure11-distribution-of-random-variable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure3-distribution-of-random-variable — ZFC Measure3 Distribution Of Random Variable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c202e401aa180874\" href=\"?note=c202e401aa180874\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,Y,\\mathcal T,X,\\nu,B,\\omega,\\mu\\in V\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,Y,\\mathcal T,X,\\nu,B,\\omega,\\mu\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c202e401aa180874\" href=\"?note=c202e401aa180874\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3DistributionOfRandomVariable}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3DistributionOfRandomVariable}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11DistributionOfRandomVariable}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11DistributionOfRandomVariable}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure3\\text{-}distribution\\text{-}of\\text{-}random\\text{-}variable} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3DistributionOfRandomVariable}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,Y,\\mathcal T,X,\\nu)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,Y,\\mathcal T)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,Y,\\mathcal T)\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal T\\;(\\nu(B)=\\mathbb P(X^{-1}[B]))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure3\\text{-}distribution\\text{-}of\\text{-}random\\text{-}variable} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3DistributionOfRandomVariable}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,Y,\\mathcal T,X,\\nu)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,Y,\\mathcal T)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,Y,\\mathcal T)\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal T\\;(\\nu(B)=\\mathbb P(X^{-1}[B]))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure3\\text{-}distribution\\text{-}of\\text{-}random\\text{-}variable} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11DistributionOfRandomVariable}_S(\\nu,X,\\mu,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\Omega,\\mathcal F,Y\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,Y,\\mathcal T)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,Y,\\mathcal T)\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal T\\;(\\nu(B)=\\mu(X^{-1}[B]))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure3\\text{-}distribution\\text{-}of\\text{-}random\\text{-}variable} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11DistributionOfRandomVariable}_S(\\nu,X,\\mu,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\Omega,\\mathcal F,Y\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,Y,\\mathcal T)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,Y,\\mathcal T)\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal T\\;(\\nu(B)=\\mu(X^{-1}[B]))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li>The measure11 distribution-of-random-variable variant is merged here.</li>\n<li>Both variants now type the pushforward itself as a measure and type <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> as a measurable map into the stated codomain sigma algebra.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"c202e401aa180874","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"c202e401aa180874","anchor":"ref-5","tar